{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UmcsT2WX13i99KmBZ714Hk","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 6 edits have been applied to `/private/tmp/async-orders-dashboard/api/orders.js`:\n\n1. Added `upsellMetafield` and `upsellPaidMetafield` to the GraphQL query after `consultationStatusMetafield`\n2. Added `upsell`, `upsell_paid`, and `upsell_paid_at` parsing in the `.map()` function before `tags`\n3. Added `getNextCutoffAfter` and `isOrderOverdue` helper functions before the approved orders filter\n4. Replaced the simple approved filter with upsell-aware filtering (approved orders exclude unpaid upsells) plus a new `awaitingUpsellOrders` array\n5. Added sort for `awaitingUpsellOrders`, plus `awaitingUpsellValue`, `awaitingUpsellItems`, and `overdueCount` calculations\n6. Added `awaitingUpsell` block and `overdueCount` to the response JSON"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ad272abf6f3f6ce29 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 16669\ntool_uses: 7\nduration_ms: 53272</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"652984ef-afb7-4f4d-8ebb-d98b5eef4f87","uuid":"8c5d1e88-789f-4ed5-b859-b8a44f32c3df","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Edit /private/tmp/async-orders-dashboard/api/orders.js with the following changes. Read the file first to confirm, then make ALL these edits:\n\n1. **Add upsell metafields to GraphQL query** — after the `consultationStatusMetafield` block (around line 86-88), add:\n```graphql\n                upsellMetafield: metafield(namespace: \"custom\", key: \"upsell\") {\n                  value\n                }\n                upsellPaidMetafield: metafield(namespace: \"custom\", key: \"upsell_paid\") {\n                  value\n                  updatedAt\n                }\n```\n\n2. **Add upsell parsing in the .map() function** — after the `consultation_status_updated_at` line (around line 187), and BEFORE the `tags:` line (around line 188), add these fields to the return object:\n```javascript\n          upsell: (() => {\n            const v = node.upsellMetafield?.value?.toLowerCase?.() || '';\n            if (v === 'true' || v === '1' || v === 'yes') return true;\n            if (v === 'false' || v === '0' || v === 'no') return false;\n            return null;\n          })(),\n          upsell_paid: (() => {\n            const v = node.upsellPaidMetafield?.value?.toLowerCase?.() || '';\n            if (v === 'true' || v === '1' || v === 'yes') return true;\n            if (v === 'false' || v === '0' || v === 'no') return false;\n            return null;\n          })(),\n          upsell_paid_at: (() => {\n            const v = node.upsellPaidMetafield?.value?.toLowerCase?.() || '';\n            return (v === 'true' || v === '1' || v === 'yes') ? (node.upsellPaidMetafield?.updatedAt || null) : null;\n          })(),\n```\n\n3. **Add overdue helper function** — BEFORE the line `const approvedOrders = filteredOrders.filter(...)` (around line 214), add:\n```javascript\n    // Overdue helper: check if any 7AM or 12PM PHT cutoff has passed since start time\n    const getNextCutoffAfter = (date) => {\n      const d = new Date(date);\n      const phtDate = new Date(d.getTime() + 8 * 3600000); // Convert to PHT\n      const year = phtDate.getUTCFullYear();\n      const month = phtDate.getUTCMonth();\n      const day = phtDate.getUTCDate();\n      const cutoff7am = new Date(Date.UTC(year, month, day, 7, 0, 0) - 8 * 3600000);\n      const cutoff12pm = new Date(Date.UTC(year, month, day, 12, 0, 0) - 8 * 3600000);\n      if (d < cutoff7am) return cutoff7am;\n      if (d < cutoff12pm) return cutoff12pm;\n      return new Date(Date.UTC(year, month, day + 1, 7, 0, 0) - 8 * 3600000);\n    };\n\n    const isOrderOverdue = (order) => {\n      let startTime;\n      if (order.upsell === true) {\n        if (!order.upsell_paid) return false;\n        startTime = new Date(order.upsell_paid_at);\n      } else {\n        if (!order.approved_at) return false;\n        startTime = new Date(order.approved_at);\n      }\n      return new Date() > getNextCutoffAfter(startTime);\n    };\n\n```\n\n4. **Change the approved orders filtering** — Replace:\n```javascript\n    const approvedOrders = filteredOrders.filter(o => o.approved_to_ship === true);\n```\nWith:\n```javascript\n    // Fulfillment ready: approved AND (no upsell needed OR upsell is paid)\n    const approvedOrders = filteredOrders\n      .filter(o => {\n        if (o.approved_to_ship !== true) return false;\n        if (o.upsell === true) return o.upsell_paid === true;\n        return true;\n      })\n      .map(o => ({ ...o, overdue: isOrderOverdue(o) }));\n\n    // Awaiting upsell payment: approved but upsell not yet paid\n    const awaitingUpsellOrders = filteredOrders\n      .filter(o => o.approved_to_ship === true && o.upsell === true && o.upsell_paid !== true);\n```\n\n5. **Add awaitingUpsell sort and summary** — After the `notApprovedOrders.sort(...)` line, add:\n```javascript\n    awaitingUpsellOrders.sort((a, b) => new Date(b.created_at) - new Date(a.created_at));\n```\n\nAnd after the notApproved summary calculations (notApprovedValue/notApprovedItems), add:\n```javascript\n    // Calculate totals for awaiting upsell\n    const awaitingUpsellValue = awaitingUpsellOrders.reduce((sum, o) => sum + parseFloat(o.total_price || 0), 0);\n    const awaitingUpsellItems = awaitingUpsellOrders.reduce((sum, o) => \n      sum + (o.line_items?.reduce((s, i) => s + i.quantity, 0) || 0), 0);\n    \n    const overdueCount = approvedOrders.filter(o => o.overdue).length;\n```\n\n6. **Add awaitingUpsell and overdue to the response JSON** — In the res.json() call, after the `notApproved` block, add:\n```javascript\n      awaitingUpsell: {\n        orders: awaitingUpsellOrders,\n        summary: {\n          count: awaitingUpsellOrders.length,\n          totalValue: awaitingUpsellValue.toFixed(2),\n          totalItems: awaitingUpsellItems,\n          currency: awaitingUpsellOrders[0]?.currency || 'PHP'\n        }\n      },\n      overdueCount,\n```\n\nMake sure to preserve all existing code and not break any existing logic. The not-approved filtering stays the same.","agentId":"ad272abf6f3f6ce29","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 6 edits have been applied to `/private/tmp/async-orders-dashboard/api/orders.js`:\n\n1. Added `upsellMetafield` and `upsellPaidMetafield` to the GraphQL query after `consultationStatusMetafield`\n2. Added `upsell`, `upsell_paid`, and `upsell_paid_at` parsing in the `.map()` function before `tags`\n3. Added `getNextCutoffAfter` and `isOrderOverdue` helper functions before the approved orders filter\n4. Replaced the simple approved filter with upsell-aware filtering (approved orders exclude unpaid upsells) plus a new `awaitingUpsellOrders` array\n5. Added sort for `awaitingUpsellOrders`, plus `awaitingUpsellValue`, `awaitingUpsellItems`, and `overdueCount` calculations\n6. Added `awaitingUpsell` block and `overdueCount` to the response JSON"}],"totalDurationMs":53272,"totalTokens":16669,"totalToolUseCount":7,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":471,"cache_read_input_tokens":15960,"output_tokens":237,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":471},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
