{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017mvnanq1AjPCYsckuzAEpV","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 8 edits have been applied successfully to `/private/tmp/async-orders-dashboard/api/cron.js`. Here is a summary of the changes:\n\n1. **GraphQL query** -- Added `updatedAt` to `approved_to_ship` metafield (line 69), and added `upsellMetafield` and `upsellPaidMetafield` queries (lines 83-89).\n\n2. **Order mapping** -- Added `approved_at`, `upsell`, `upsell_paid`, and `upsell_paid_at` fields to the returned order objects (lines 168, 181-196).\n\n3. **Overdue helper and filtering** -- Added `getNextCutoffAfter` and `isOrderOverdue` helper functions (lines 200-224). Changed `approvedOrders` filter to exclude upsell orders awaiting payment and added `overdue` flag. Added new `awaitingUpsellOrders` array (lines 227-235).\n\n4. **New counts** -- Added `overdueOrders` and `awaitingUpsellTotalValue` calculations (lines 251-252).\n\n5. **Email summary** -- Updated to include overdue count, awaiting upsell payment line, and updated total pending count (lines 265-275).\n\n6. **New email sections** -- Added Overdue Orders section and Awaiting Upsell Payment section before the Approved Orders section (lines 280-318). Added upsell paid status in approved orders listing (lines 342-344).\n\n7. **Email subject** -- Now conditionally includes overdue count when there are overdue orders (lines 408-410).\n\n8. **Response JSON** -- Added `overdueCount` and `awaitingUpsellCount` fields (lines 424-425). Updated `totalPendingOrders` to include `awaitingUpsellOrders` (line 397)."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a376d5a5865df53d9 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 29540\ntool_uses: 14\nduration_ms: 104364</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"652984ef-afb7-4f4d-8ebb-d98b5eef4f87","uuid":"1f36e1ce-71f0-429c-af6c-ecc5c0d3f26d","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Edit /private/tmp/async-orders-dashboard/api/cron.js with the following changes. Read the file first to confirm, then make ALL these edits:\n\n1. **Add upsell metafields to GraphQL query** — after the `orderStatusMetafield` block (around line 79-81), add:\n```graphql\n                upsellMetafield: metafield(namespace: \"custom\", key: \"upsell\") {\n                  value\n                }\n                upsellPaidMetafield: metafield(namespace: \"custom\", key: \"upsell_paid\") {\n                  value\n                  updatedAt\n                }\n```\n\nAlso add `updatedAt` to the existing approved_to_ship metafield (line 67-69). Change:\n```graphql\n                metafield(namespace: \"custom\", key: \"approved_to_ship\") {\n                  value\n                }\n```\nto:\n```graphql\n                metafield(namespace: \"custom\", key: \"approved_to_ship\") {\n                  value\n                  updatedAt\n                }\n```\n\n2. **Add upsell parsing and approved_at in the .map()** — In the return object (around line 153-173), add `approved_at` field after `approved_to_ship`:\n```javascript\n          approved_at: approvedToShip === true ? (metafield?.updatedAt || null) : null,\n```\n\nAnd before the closing `};` of the return object, add:\n```javascript\n          upsell: (() => {\n            const v = node.upsellMetafield?.value?.toLowerCase?.() || '';\n            if (v === 'true' || v === '1' || v === 'yes') return true;\n            if (v === 'false' || v === '0' || v === 'no') return false;\n            return null;\n          })(),\n          upsell_paid: (() => {\n            const v = node.upsellPaidMetafield?.value?.toLowerCase?.() || '';\n            if (v === 'true' || v === '1' || v === 'yes') return true;\n            if (v === 'false' || v === '0' || v === 'no') return false;\n            return null;\n          })(),\n          upsell_paid_at: (() => {\n            const v = node.upsellPaidMetafield?.value?.toLowerCase?.() || '';\n            return (v === 'true' || v === '1' || v === 'yes') ? (node.upsellPaidMetafield?.updatedAt || null) : null;\n          })(),\n```\n\n3. **Add overdue helper and change filtering** — Before `const approvedOrders = filteredOrders.filter(...)` (around line 176), add:\n```javascript\n    // Overdue helper\n    const getNextCutoffAfter = (date) => {\n      const d = new Date(date);\n      const phtDate = new Date(d.getTime() + 8 * 3600000);\n      const year = phtDate.getUTCFullYear();\n      const month = phtDate.getUTCMonth();\n      const day = phtDate.getUTCDate();\n      const cutoff7am = new Date(Date.UTC(year, month, day, 7, 0, 0) - 8 * 3600000);\n      const cutoff12pm = new Date(Date.UTC(year, month, day, 12, 0, 0) - 8 * 3600000);\n      if (d < cutoff7am) return cutoff7am;\n      if (d < cutoff12pm) return cutoff12pm;\n      return new Date(Date.UTC(year, month, day + 1, 7, 0, 0) - 8 * 3600000);\n    };\n\n    const isOrderOverdue = (order) => {\n      let startTime;\n      if (order.upsell === true) {\n        if (!order.upsell_paid) return false;\n        startTime = new Date(order.upsell_paid_at);\n      } else {\n        if (!order.approved_at) return false;\n        startTime = new Date(order.approved_at);\n      }\n      return new Date() > getNextCutoffAfter(startTime);\n    };\n\n```\n\nReplace:\n```javascript\n    const approvedOrders = filteredOrders.filter(o => o.approved_to_ship === true);\n    const notApprovedOrders = filteredOrders.filter(o => o.approved_to_ship === false);\n```\nWith:\n```javascript\n    const approvedOrders = filteredOrders\n      .filter(o => {\n        if (o.approved_to_ship !== true) return false;\n        if (o.upsell === true) return o.upsell_paid === true;\n        return true;\n      })\n      .map(o => ({ ...o, overdue: isOrderOverdue(o) }));\n    const awaitingUpsellOrders = filteredOrders\n      .filter(o => o.approved_to_ship === true && o.upsell === true && o.upsell_paid !== true);\n    const notApprovedOrders = filteredOrders.filter(o => o.approved_to_ship === false);\n```\n\n4. **Add overdue + awaiting upsell counts** — After `notApprovedTotalItems` calculation, add:\n```javascript\n    const overdueOrders = approvedOrders.filter(o => o.overdue);\n    const awaitingUpsellTotalValue = awaitingUpsellOrders.reduce((sum, o) => sum + parseFloat(o.total_price || 0), 0);\n```\n\n5. **Update email body** — Update the SUMMARY section to include overdue and awaiting upsell. After the existing summary lines, add overdue and awaiting upsell info.\n\nChange the summary to:\n```javascript\n    emailBody += `SUMMARY\\n`;\n    emailBody += `-`.repeat(30) + `\\n`;\n    if (overdueOrders.length > 0) {\n      emailBody += `🚨 OVERDUE: ${overdueOrders.length} orders\\n`;\n    }\n    emailBody += `Approved Orders: ${approvedOrders.length} (${currency} ${approvedTotalValue.toLocaleString()}, ${approvedTotalItems} items)\\n`;\n    if (awaitingUpsellOrders.length > 0) {\n      emailBody += `Awaiting Upsell Payment: ${awaitingUpsellOrders.length} (${currency} ${awaitingUpsellTotalValue.toLocaleString()})\\n`;\n    }\n    emailBody += `Not Approved Orders: ${notApprovedOrders.length} (${currency} ${notApprovedTotalValue.toLocaleString()}, ${notApprovedTotalItems} items)\\n`;\n    emailBody += `Total Pending: ${approvedOrders.length + awaitingUpsellOrders.length + notApprovedOrders.length} orders\\n\\n`;\n```\n\n6. **Add OVERDUE section at TOP of email body (before approved orders)** — Before the \"APPROVED ORDERS SECTION\" comment, add:\n```javascript\n      // OVERDUE ORDERS SECTION\n      if (overdueOrders.length > 0) {\n        emailBody += `🚨 OVERDUE ORDERS (${overdueOrders.length})\\n`;\n        emailBody += `-`.repeat(30) + `\\n\\n`;\n        overdueOrders.forEach((order, i) => {\n          const customerName = [order.customer?.first_name, order.customer?.last_name].filter(Boolean).join(' ') || 'Guest';\n          const orderDate = new Date(order.created_at).toLocaleDateString('en-PH', { timeZone: 'Asia/Manila' });\n          emailBody += `${i + 1}. ${order.name} - ${customerName}\\n`;\n          emailBody += `   Date: ${orderDate}\\n`;\n          emailBody += `   Total: ${order.currency} ${parseFloat(order.total_price).toLocaleString()}\\n`;\n          if (order.upsell === true) {\n            emailBody += `   Upsell: Paid ✅ (${new Date(order.upsell_paid_at).toLocaleDateString('en-PH', { timeZone: 'Asia/Manila' })})\\n`;\n          }\n          emailBody += `   Items:\\n`;\n          order.line_items?.forEach(item => {\n            emailBody += `     - ${item.quantity}× ${item.title}\\n`;\n          });\n          emailBody += `\\n`;\n        });\n      }\n\n      // AWAITING UPSELL PAYMENT SECTION\n      if (awaitingUpsellOrders.length > 0) {\n        emailBody += `💰 AWAITING UPSELL PAYMENT (${awaitingUpsellOrders.length})\\n`;\n        emailBody += `-`.repeat(30) + `\\n\\n`;\n        awaitingUpsellOrders.forEach((order, i) => {\n          const customerName = [order.customer?.first_name, order.customer?.last_name].filter(Boolean).join(' ') || 'Guest';\n          const orderDate = new Date(order.created_at).toLocaleDateString('en-PH', { timeZone: 'Asia/Manila' });\n          emailBody += `${i + 1}. ${order.name} - ${customerName}\\n`;\n          emailBody += `   Date: ${orderDate}\\n`;\n          emailBody += `   Total: ${order.currency} ${parseFloat(order.total_price).toLocaleString()}\\n`;\n          emailBody += `   Upsell: Awaiting Payment ⏳\\n`;\n          emailBody += `   Items:\\n`;\n          order.line_items?.forEach(item => {\n            emailBody += `     - ${item.quantity}× ${item.title}\\n`;\n          });\n          emailBody += `\\n`;\n        });\n      }\n```\n\nIn the approved orders section, add upsell status for each approved order. After the delivery date line in the approved section, add:\n```javascript\n          if (order.upsell === true) {\n            emailBody += `   Upsell: Paid ✅\\n`;\n          }\n```\n\n7. **Update email subject** — Change the subject line to include overdue count:\n```javascript\n        subject: overdueOrders.length > 0\n          ? `🚨 ${overdueOrders.length} OVERDUE | 📦 ${approvedOrders.length} ready to ship, ${notApprovedOrders.length + awaitingUpsellOrders.length} pending - ${today}`\n          : `📦 Daily Fulfillment Report: ${approvedOrders.length} approved, ${notApprovedOrders.length} not approved - ${today}`,\n```\n\n8. **Update response** — Add overdueCount and awaitingUpsellCount to the response JSON.\n\nMake sure all existing code is preserved and not broken. Read the file first to understand the exact line numbers and context.","agentId":"a376d5a5865df53d9","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 8 edits have been applied successfully to `/private/tmp/async-orders-dashboard/api/cron.js`. Here is a summary of the changes:\n\n1. **GraphQL query** -- Added `updatedAt` to `approved_to_ship` metafield (line 69), and added `upsellMetafield` and `upsellPaidMetafield` queries (lines 83-89).\n\n2. **Order mapping** -- Added `approved_at`, `upsell`, `upsell_paid`, and `upsell_paid_at` fields to the returned order objects (lines 168, 181-196).\n\n3. **Overdue helper and filtering** -- Added `getNextCutoffAfter` and `isOrderOverdue` helper functions (lines 200-224). Changed `approvedOrders` filter to exclude upsell orders awaiting payment and added `overdue` flag. Added new `awaitingUpsellOrders` array (lines 227-235).\n\n4. **New counts** -- Added `overdueOrders` and `awaitingUpsellTotalValue` calculations (lines 251-252).\n\n5. **Email summary** -- Updated to include overdue count, awaiting upsell payment line, and updated total pending count (lines 265-275).\n\n6. **New email sections** -- Added Overdue Orders section and Awaiting Upsell Payment section before the Approved Orders section (lines 280-318). Added upsell paid status in approved orders listing (lines 342-344).\n\n7. **Email subject** -- Now conditionally includes overdue count when