onst awaitingUpsellValue = awaitingUpsellOrders.reduce((sum, o) => sum + parseFloat(o.total_price || 0), 0);\n```\n\n6. **Update email body** — Add overdue alert at top of email body. After the first line \"Hi team! 👋\\n\\n\", if there are overdue orders, add:\n```javascript\n    if (overdueOrders.length > 0) {\n      emailBody += `🚨 **OVERDUE: ${overdueOrders.length} order(s) past their fulfillment cutoff!**\\n\\n`;\n    }\n```\n\nAfter the \"Pending Approval\" line, add awaiting upsell:\n```javascript\n    if (awaitingUpsellOrders.length > 0) {\n      emailBody += `💰 **Awaiting Upsell Payment**\\n`;\n      emailBody += `   ${awaitingUpsellOrders.length} orders · PHP ${awaitingUpsellValue.toLocaleString()}\\n\\n`;\n    }\n```\n\n7. **Update email subject** — Change to include overdue:\n```javascript\n          subject: overdueOrders.length > 0\n            ? `🚨 ${overdueOrders.length} OVERDUE | 📦 ${approvedOrders.length} ready to ship, ${notApprovedOrders.length} pending`\n            : `📦 Daily Fulfillment Report — ${approvedOrders.length} ready to ship, ${notApprovedOrders.length} pending`,\n```\n\n8. **Update attachments** — Add a third CSV for awaiting upsell if there are any. After the not-approved CSV attachment, add:\n```javascript\n            ...(awaitingUpsellOrders.length > 0 ? [{\n              filename: `AWAITING_UPSELL_${dateStr}.csv`,\n              content: btoa(unescape(encodeURIComponent(generateCSV(awaitingUpsellOrders)))),\n              content_type: 'text/csv'\n            }] : []),\n```\n\nAnd update the email body to mention this third CSV if applicable.\n\n9. **Update response** — Add awaitingUpsell and overdueCount to the response.\n\nMake sure all existing code is preserved. Read the file first to understand exact context.","agentId":"a15ce4c65404a25b4","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 9 edits have been applied successfully to `/private/tmp/async-orders-dashboard/api/send-email.js`. Here's a summary of what was changed:\n\n1. **Graph